# Applied Energistics 2 – level emitters, light detecting fixture, storage and conversion monitor, signal
# File ae2emitter.lang -> key prefix 'ae2emitter.'

# --- settings page of the level emitters
filter = Watched item ({used}/{slots}) – empty: all items count
threshold.items = Threshold: {value}
threshold.energy = Threshold: {value} AE
setting.level.high_signal = Signal: at or above the threshold
setting.level.low_signal = Signal: below the threshold
setting.energy.high_signal = Signal: at or above the threshold
setting.energy.low_signal = Signal: below the threshold
setting.craft.no = Signal: while the item is being crafted
setting.craft.yes = Signal: to craft the item
info.level = {item}: {amount} of {threshold}
info.energy = Energy: {amount} of {threshold} AE
info.crafting = {item}: crafting requests
watch.all = All items
value.above = more than {threshold}
signal.on = signal on
signal.off = signal off
note.item = Blocks next to the emitter receive the signal, for example a bus with a Redstone Card. A Fuzzy Card counts all variants of the item, a Crafting Card reacts to crafting jobs instead of the amount.
note.all = Without an item the emitter adds up everything stored in the network.
note.energy = Compares the energy stored in the network with the threshold. Blocks next to the emitter receive the signal.
note.whileCrafting = Crafting Card: the signal is on while a crafting CPU waits for this item (without an item: for anything).
note.craftVia = Crafting Card: the item can be requested for crafting. While a job waits for it the signal is on – whatever it switches on has to deliver the item into the network.
hint.emitter = Click an item above to select it, then click the item slot or the card slot. Right click adds it directly. Click a filled slot to clear it or to take the card out.

# --- buses with a Redstone Card
bus.signalOn = Redstone Card: this bus receives a signal from a block next to it.
bus.signalOff = Redstone Card: no signal. Level emitters and light detecting fixtures next to this bus send one.

